# Byte-identical artifacts: model packages record SHA256 hashes of their exact
# file bytes. Git must never normalize line endings (or otherwise touch the
# bytes) of these files, or validate_package() will fail on a fresh clone.
# (Incident 2026-10-04: Windows CRLF writes were hashed on the training laptop,
# then normalized to LF on commit, breaking every recorded text-artifact hash.)
models/candidates/** -text
outputs/** -text
*.h5 -text
*.joblib -text
*.pkl -text
